Palmimo face display firmware

This bundle declares its available protocols in firmware.json under
/usr/local/lib/palmimo/display-firmware. Protocols 1 and 2 use face_serial_v1.bin.gz and face_serial_v2.bin.gz.
The updater installs it during boot and Portal platform updates.

The Jizai Inc. portions of the face display firmware binaries (v1 and v2)
and standard display assets are licensed under Apache-2.0, like this repository.
Third-party portions retain their own licenses; their notices and full license
texts are in NOTICE and licenses/ in this directory. The canonical copies are in the repository's
files/boot/firmware/licenses/display-firmware/; tests require byte equality.

NOTICE-v2 records the v2 source notices and linked Pico SDK / TinyUSB components.
The shared license texts remain in licenses/.
